### =======================================================================
### StockFlow API Client Test Suite (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Senior Capstone Demonstration Workflows
### =======================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH & METRICS
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Check System Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Check Prometheus Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & TOKENS
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Login as Customer
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@stockflow.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Customer Access Token
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@customerRefreshToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Login as Seller
# @name sellerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller@stockflow.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Seller Access Token
@sellerToken = {{sellerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login as Administrator
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@stockflow.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Admin Access Token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Rotate Access Token using Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{customerRefreshToken}}"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CATALOG & SEARCH
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Search Public Products with Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?minPrice=50&maxPrice=300&page=0&size=10

### List Active Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Admin: Update Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Audio Equipment & Accessories",
  "description": "Premium audio gear and headphones"
}

### Admin: Deactivate Category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. CART & CHECKOUT WORKFLOW
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### View Customer Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Add Seed Item to Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-AUDIO-PRO-BLK",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Checkout Order with Idempotency Key
# @name checkoutOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: c9d8e7a6-b5c4-4d3e-2f1a-0b9c8d7e6f5a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "450 University Ave, Palo Alto, CA"
}

### Store Created Order ID
@orderId = {{checkoutOrder.response.body.id}}

### Retry Same Checkout with Same Idempotency Key (Demonstrates Cached Idempotency 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: c9d8e7a6-b5c4-4d3e-2f1a-0b9c8d7e6f5a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "450 University Ave, Palo Alto, CA"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. NON-BLOCKING PAYMENT INITIATION
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Initiate Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}"
}

### Ingest Signed Provider Webhook (Simulating Payment Gateway Callback)
# Note: HMAC-SHA256 of payload with secret "whsec_test_mock_secret_key_12345"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhooks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Signature: 669a9e334a132fa07b22a0ce8cce393526543b5735e5d1645e76cae75ea8b948

{
  "eventId": "evt_test_webhook_001",
  "eventType": "payment.succeeded",
  "providerReference": "PAY-MOCK-REF-12345",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": 199.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "status": "SUCCEEDED"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SELLER FULFILMENT & TRACKING
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Dispatch Shipment (Seller Auth)
# @name createShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/fulfilment/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "carrier": "FedEx Ground",
  "trackingNumber": "TRK-FEDEX-998877"
}

@shipmentId = {{createShipment.response.body.id}}

### Confirm Delivery (Carrier/Seller Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fulfilment/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. RETURNS, RESTOCK POLICY & REFUNDS
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Customer Requests Return
# @name returnRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "reason": "Exchanged mind, item unopened."
}

@returnId = {{returnRequest.response.body.id}}

### Seller Approves Return
POST {{baseUrl}}/returns/{{returnId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "comments": "Approved for return within 30-day window"
}

### Seller Receives Return and Restocks to Inventory
POST {{baseUrl}}/returns/{{returnId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restockDecision": "RESTOCK"
}

### Seller Issues Refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/returns/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": 199.99,
  "reason": "Full refund upon restock verification"
}

### Customer: List My Return Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Seller: List Store Return Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/returns/seller
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Seller: List Dispatched Shipments
GET {{baseUrl}}/fulfilment/seller
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Seller: Re-activate Product Listing
POST {{baseUrl}}/seller/products/a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. ADMINISTRATIVE REPORTS & AUDIT TRAIL
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### High-level Operational Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Security & Financial Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/audit-logs?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. CONVERSATIONAL AI CHATBOT (ALL USER PERSONAS)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 Guest: Search Products & Discover Catalog
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show available products in the catalog",
  "sessionId": "guest-session-101"
}

### 9.2 Guest: Inquire about Return & Refund Policies
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the return and refund policy?",
  "sessionId": "guest-session-101"
}

### 9.3 Customer: Check Recent Orders (Context-Aware)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show my recent orders and tracking status",
  "sessionId": "customer-session-201"
}

### 9.4 Customer: Check Active Cart Items
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What items are in my cart right now?",
  "sessionId": "customer-session-201"
}

### 9.5 Customer: Ask if Order is Eligible for Cancellation
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Can I cancel my pending order?",
  "sessionId": "customer-session-201"
}

### 9.6 Seller: Low Stock & Restock Alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show my low stock items and inventory alerts",
  "sessionId": "seller-session-301"
}

### 9.7 Seller: Check Store Listings & Customer Returns
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Any pending return requests for my store?",
  "sessionId": "seller-session-301"
}

### 9.8 Admin: Query Platform Revenue & Operational Health
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show platform operational metrics and total revenue",
  "sessionId": "admin-session-401"
}

### 9.9 Admin: Inspect Outbox Queue & Background Telemetry
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/message
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Check outbox queue status and background workers",
  "sessionId": "admin-session-401"
}

### 9.10 List User's Past Chat Conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
